orpus loader dao.jing.cbor-fixtures (isolates these checks from the real corpus loader); see src/dev/jolt_diag/dao/jing/cbor_fixtures.cljc\"\nbb.edn:237:                         \". build/tools/jolt-env.sh && \\\"$JOLT_HOME/bin/jolt\\\" -Srepro -M:jolt:jolt-diag:jolt-test src/dev/jolt_test_runner.clj dao.host.float-test dao.host.text-test\")))}\nbb.edn:239:  test:jolt-json\nbb.edn:243:                         \". build/tools/jolt-env.sh && \\\"$JOLT_HOME/bin/jolt\\\" -Srepro -M:jolt:jolt-test src/dev/jolt_test_runner.clj jolt-json-shim-check\")))}\nbb.edn:245:  test:jolt-runner-self\nbb.edn:246:  {:doc \"J1: prove src/dev/jolt_test_runner.clj counts a throwing test as one error and keeps running (the jolt-runner-sentinel namespace)\"\nbb.edn:249:                         \". build/tools/jolt-env.sh && \\\"$JOLT_HOME/bin/jolt\\\" -Srepro -M:jolt:jolt-test src/dev/jolt_test_runner.clj --self-test\")))}\nbb.edn:305:  {:doc \"Babashka-only, no natives: scan deps.edn :paths + :cljs :extra-paths for .cljc/.cljs namespaces outside test/ matching shadow-cljs.edn :test :ns-regexp (default -test$); fail before Node discovery can load JVM-only code. Rename the ns or guard it with reader conditionals. Self-test: bb src/dev/check_node_discovery_test.clj\"\nbb.edn:312:  test:cljd {:doc \"Dart tests, fast: aggregated shards via src/dev/cljd_agg.clj; guarded bodies print SKIP\"\nbb.edn:326:  test:all:cljd {:doc \"Every Dart test, guarded slow bodies included (sets DATOM_SLOW_TESTS=1)\"\nbb.edn:348:  test:slow:cljd {:doc \"Dart: only generated tests of namespaces with dao.test-slow/guard, bodies enabled (DATOM_SLOW_TESTS=1)\"\nbb.edn:354:             :depends [test:slow:clj test:slow:cljs test:slow:cljd]}\nbb.edn:357:            :depends [test:all:clj test:all:cljs test:all:cljd]}\nbb.edn:360:        :depends [build:yin-repl-peer build:yin-repl-node test:clj test:cljs test:cljd]}\nbb.edn:399:  test:changed:cljd {:doc \"Dart lane of test:changed\"\nbb.edn:446:  test:sub:cljd {:doc \"D